  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 500eb (Expensive)</p>\n<p><em>Improves internal synthetic musculature systems.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Skate Foot Cyberware Enhancement.</strong> This enhancement applies to two different installations of Skate Foot on separate legs when installed. Installed Skate Feet no longer resemble inline skates, and instead boost the user’s usual running motions with concealed micro-motors. Additionally, the movement bonus provided to the Run Action is increased to 8m/yds.</p>\n<p><strong>Enhances:</strong> Skate Foot<br>\n<strong>Option Slots:</strong> 0 (Cyberware Enhancement)</p>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Cyberware &gt; Cyberlegs).</em></p>"
